opy -->\n    <div class=\"hap-copy\">\n\n      <!-- App ID badge -->\n      <div class=\"hap-appid\">\n        <svg width=\"24\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 23\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;\">\n          <rect width=\"24\" height=\"23\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#EB1000\" ></rect>\n          <path d=\"M12 5.5L16.5 16H7.5L12 5.5Z\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" ></path>\n          <line x1=\"9\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"13\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" ></line>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"hap-appid-text\">PDF &amp; Productivity</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Headline + body text -->\n      <div class=\"hap-hl-wrap\">\n        <h1 class=\"hap-headline\">With great power comes great productivity.</h1>\n        <p class=\"hap-body\">Do your best work faster with AI-powered document insights, secure collaboration, and professional content creation — all in one place.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Promo CTA bar -->\n      <div class=\"hap-promo\">\n        <div class=\"hap-promo-brand\">\n          <div class=\"hap-promo-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 19\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path d=\"M10 3L15 14H5L10 3Z\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" ></path>\n              <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"13\" y2=\"11\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" ></line>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"hap-promo-label\">Try Acrobat Studio</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hap-promo-arrow\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Get started\">\n          <svg width=\"22\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <path d=\"M1 9H21M14 2L21 9L14 16\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" ></path>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hap-promo-plus\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"More options\">\n          <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-plus.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;object-fit:contain;display:block;background:transparent;\" />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Image gallery strip -->\n  <div class=\"hap-gallery\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\n    <!-- Column 1: shorter start, big finish -->\n    <div class=\"hap-gcol\">\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810732.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:291px;\" />\n      <div class=\"hap-c1img2\" style=\"height:292px;\">\n        <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle2147231490.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:100%;border-radius:0;\" />\n      </div>\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810731.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:394px;\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 2: tall start -->\n    <div class=\"hap-gcol\">\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107321.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:394px;\" />\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col2img02.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:292px;\" />\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810724.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:393px;\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 3: shorter start -->\n    <div class=\"hap-gcol\">\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810734.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:291px;\" />\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col5img02.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:292px;\" />\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810735.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:392px;\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 4: two images, centred -->\n    <div class=\"hap-gcol\">\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:291px;\" />\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107311.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:394px;\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Column 5: four images with research card -->\n    <div class=\"hap-gcol\">\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810729.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:291px;\" />\n      <div class=\"hap-research\" style=\"height:393px;\">\n        <img class=\"hap-research-bg\" src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810727.png\" alt=\"\" />\n        <div class=\"hap-research-body\">\n          <p style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13.5px;line-height:17px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Nutrition of Teenage Girls and Women in Humanitarian Crises</p>\n          <p style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:6px;line-height:8.5px;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 4px 0;\">Global humanitarian crises have reached unprecedented scale and complexity, with the world now facing the most severe food and nutrition crisis in modern history. In just three years since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic, the number of people in need of humanitarian assistance has surged from 168 million to an alarming 339 million.</p>\n          <p style=\"font-family:'Source Serif Pro',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:6px;line-height:8.5px;color:#29293e;margin:0 0 4px 0;\">Humanitarian crises are growing more severe, disruptive, and prolonged than ever before. Many countries are confronting overlapping shocks — conflict and instability, extreme weather events, and disease outbreaks.</p>\n          <p style=\"font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:5px;line-height:6px;color:#5a5a87;margin:10px 0 4px 0;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">SPECIAL REPORT</p>\n          <p style=\"font-family:'Aktiv Grotesk','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:5px;line-height:6px;color:#29293e;margin:0;\">By Dr. Heather Esme-Collins MBBS, MRCPCH, MMed</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col4img02.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:394px;\" />\n      <img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107241.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"height:393px;\" />\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>",
      "authorContentHtml": "<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-navBarContainer.png\" alt=\"Nav Bar Container\"></picture>\nPDF &amp; Productivity\n<h1>With great power comes great productivity.</h1>\n        <p>Do your best work faster with AI-powered document insights, secure collaboration, and professional content creation — all in one place.</p>\nTry Acrobat Studio\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-plus.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810732.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle2147231490.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810731.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107321.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n      <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col2img02.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n      <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810724.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810734.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n      <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col5img02.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n      <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810735.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-image.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n      <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107311.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810729.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle810727.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n<p>Nutrition of Teenage Girls and Women in Humanitarian Crises</p>\n          <p>Global humanitarian crises have reached unprecedented scale and complexity, with the world now facing the most severe food and nutrition crisis in modern history. In just three years since the start of the COVID-19 pandemic, the number of people in need of humanitarian assistance has surged from 168 million to an alarming 339 million.</p>\n          <p>Humanitarian crises are growing more severe, disruptive, and prolonged than ever before. Many countries are confronting overlapping shocks — conflict and instability, extreme weather events, and disease outbreaks.</p>\n          <p>SPECIAL REPORT</p>\n          <p>By Dr. Heather Esme-Collins MBBS, MRCPCH, MMed</p>\n<picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-col4img02.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>\n      <picture><img src=\"media_bizpro-hub-rectangle8107241.png\" alt=\"\"></picture>",
